    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem dubner_conjecture (n : ℕ) (hn : 4208 < n) (h : Even n) :\n    ∃ p q : ℕ,\n      IsTwinPrime p ∧\n      IsTwinPrime q ∧\n      p + q = n",
